WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.800
AI adoption is sustained, responsible use of an AI system in real work.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:21.600
Start with a real user need and design inputs, outputs, and review steps that fit the workflow.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:32.400
Enable users with training, access, guidance, support, and clear ownership.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:43.200
Track real use, quality, and value, then use feedback to improve the system.

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:53.904
Adoption is more than a launch or a usage count: it is useful, repeated use with accountability.
